# Fretboard: always end with "What changed"

When you modify code in this repo, **the last section of your reply must be**:

## What changed

Include:
- concrete bullets (files, behavior, keys, config)
- **Verified** (build/test commands and pass/fail)
- **Try it** (rebuild + short manual check)

Do **not** finish an implementation turn without this section — even for one-line fixes,
bug batches, or when resuming a prior session. The user relies on this heading.

See `AGENTS.md` for the full template.
